19:["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["遇到",["$","code",null,{"children":"setTimeout2"}],",输出『6』，没有可以执行的微任务。执行新的宏任务。"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["遇到",["$","code",null,{"children":"setTimeout3"}],",输出『timout2』，",["$","code",null,{"children":"new promise"}],"立即执行，输出『timeout2_promise』，",["$","code",null,{"children":"then"}],"被分发到微任务Event Queue中。标记为then3\n第二轮事件循环的宏任务执行完毕。Event Queue中的任务如下表所示"]}],"\n"]}]
